  "question": "What\u2019s the nearest caf\u00e9 along the path leading from Magness Arena, CO to ECPI University Denver, Centennial, CO?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-104.961685 39.682266)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-104.860994 39.595547)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'cafe'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-104.961685 39.682266)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-104.961685 39.682266)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
